1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,413
Your Las Vegas suite could have two floors and a Strip view.

2
00:00:04,463 --> 00:00:07,208
These are the Skyloft suites at the MGM Grand.

3
00:00:07,258 --> 00:00:11,454
Premium bedding, a separate sitting area, and a fifty-five inch TV.

4
00:00:11,504 --> 00:00:14,973
Free toiletries in the bathroom, and a spa right on the property.

5
00:00:15,024 --> 00:00:17,648
One suite even has its own billiards table.

6
00:00:17,698 --> 00:00:19,549
Then head outside to the lazy river.

7
00:00:19,598 --> 00:00:24,031
Four hundred sixty-eight guest reviews single out the pool area and the lazy river.

8
00:00:24,081 --> 00:00:28,617
The outdoor pool has lifeguards, and you can rent a cabana for a surcharge.

9
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:33,282
Then walk inside to fourteen restaurants, ten bars, and two coffee shops.

10
00:00:33,332 --> 00:00:37,702
The full tour is on my channel.
